            "display_title": "This work offers a new air quality dataset. The authors describe the collection of data sources, and the processing of them. They then defined the machine learning task of predicting future air quality. Two baseline models are offered – ReducedLSTM and WIPENET. Experiments are done to demonstrate that this dataset is suitable to train deep models that predicts air quality. ",
